king to understand Egypt's rich heritage beyond the pyramids.	["Explore the mysterious underground Catacombs of Kom el Shoqafa with intricate ancient carvings", "Visit the historic Citadel of Qaitbay overlooking the Mediterranean Sea", "Enjoy authentic Egyptian cuisine with included traditional lunch", "Travel comfortably in air-conditioned transportation from Cairo", "Learn fascinating stories from expert local guide about Alexandria's golden age", "Discover the site where the legendary Lighthouse of Alexandria once stood", "Experience the unique blend of Egyptian, Greek, and Roman cultures"]	["Round-trip transportation from Cairo in air-conditioned vehicle", "Professional English-speaking guide", "Entrance fees to Catacombs of Kom el Shoqafa", "Entrance fees to Citadel of Qaitbay", "Traditional Egyptian lunch at local restaurant", "All taxes and service charges"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Beverages during lunch", "Hotel pickup and drop-off (meeting point departure)", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and a bottle of water	This tour involves walking on uneven surfaces and climbing stairs in the catacombs. The journey to Alexandria takes approximately 2.5 hours each way. Dress modestly when visiting religious and historical sites.	82.00	65.00	\N	\N	114.00	USD	Per person	28.00	82.00	600	["08:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour departure time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Central Cairo Meeting Point	Meet at designated pickup location in central Cairo area	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345023/rayna/activities/bf110246-7bbe-45f7-94d6-da6997d796b5/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345023/rayna/activities/bf110246-7bbe-45f7-94d6-da6997d796b5/0.jpg", "