3eb0f236-ee9c-44b1-aab1-916a2301e67f	From Cairo: Pyramids of Giza, Sphinx, Saqqara & Memphis Tour	from-cairo-pyramids-of-giza-sphinx-saqqara-memphis-tour-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Historical Sites	Group tour	null	enriched	Discover ancient Egypt's greatest treasures on this comprehensive day tour visiting the iconic Pyramids of Giza, mysterious Sphinx, and historic sites of Saqqara and Memphis.	Embark on an extraordinary journey through 4,500 years of Egyptian civilization with this comprehensive full-day exploration of Cairo's most magnificent ancient sites. Your adventure begins at the legendary Pyramids of Giza, where you'll stand in awe before the last surviving Wonder of the Ancient World. Marvel at the Great Pyramid of Khufu, explore the perfectly preserved Pyramid of Khafre, and discover the smaller yet equally fascinating Pyramid of Menkaure. Face-to-face with the enigmatic Great Sphinx, you'll uncover the mysteries surrounding this colossal limestone guardian that has watched over the Giza plateau for millennia. Your journey continues to Saqqara, home to the revolutionary Step Pyramid of Djoser - Egypt's oldest stone building and the architectural prototype for all future pyramids. Walk through this vast necropolis where pharaohs and nobles were laid to rest, exploring mastaba tombs adorned with intricate hieroglyphs and colorful reliefs that bring ancient Egyptian life to vivid detail. The final stop takes you to Memphis, the powerful capital of ancient Egypt for over eight centuries. Here, you'll encounter the impressive statue of Ramesses II and explore the open-air museum showcasing artifacts from this once-mighty city. Throughout your tour, expert guides will share fascinating stories, historical insights, and archaeological discoveries that illuminate the incredible achievements of ancient Egyptian civilization. This immersive experience offers unparalleled access to Egypt's most treasured monuments, providing deep cultural understanding and unforgettable memories of humanity's greatest architectural legacy.	["Explore the iconic Great Pyramid and witness the last Wonder of the Ancient World", "Stand before the mysterious Great Sphinx and learn about its ancient secrets", "Visit Saqqara's Step Pyramid, the world's oldest stone monument", "Discover the ruins of Memphis, ancient Egypt's powerful capital city", "Enjoy expert commentary from knowledgeable Egyptologist guides", "Experience comprehensive access to multiple UNESCO World Heritage sites", "Travel in comfort with convenient hotel pickup and drop-off service"]	["Professional Egyptologist tour guide", "Air-conditioned transportation", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Entrance fees to all mentioned sites", "Bottled water during the tour"]	["Entry inside the Great Pyramid (additional fee required)", "Lunch and refreshments", "Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and cash for optional pyramid interior visits	This tour involves considerable walking on uneven surfaces. Pyramid interiors may be closed for maintenance without notice. Photography inside tombs may require additional fees.	89.00	65.00	\N	\N	111.00	USD	Per person	20.00	89.00	480	["08:00", "09:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup from Cairo and Giza hotels	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345144/rayna/activities/3eb0f236-ee9c-44b1-aab1-916a2301e67f/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345144/rayna/activities/3eb0f236-ee9c-44b1-aab1-916a2301e67f/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From Cairo: Pyramids of Giza, Sphinx, Saqqara & Memphis Tour - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "r