's greatest treasures.	["Explore the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the sole surviving Wonder of the Ancient World", "Marvel at the mysterious Great Sphinx and learn about its ancient secrets", "Experience an authentic camel ride with panoramic desert views", "Enjoy personalized attention with your own private guide and vehicle", "Visit all three pyramids of Giza with detailed historical commentary", "Capture stunning photographs from unique vantage points", "Benefit from convenient hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Discover fascinating archaeological insights and ancient Egyptian culture"]	["Private professional Egyptologist guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Air-conditioned private vehicle transportation", "Camel riding experience", "Entrance fees to Giza Pyramid Complex", "Bottled water during the tour"]	["Entrance fees to inside the pyramids", "Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Lunch and refreshments", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and cash for optional purchases	Comfortable walking is required. The tour operates in all weather conditions. Camel riding is optional and suitable for most fitness levels.	48.00	35.00	\N	\N	60.00	USD	Per person	20.00	48.00	360	["08:00", "09:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour starts	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel lobby	Pickup from your Cairo or Giza hotel lobby	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345116/rayna/activities/cfda7c21-b1f9-4218-92bd-2276e73fba48/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345116/rayna/activities/cfda7c21-b1f9-4218-92bd-2276e73fba48/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Cairo: Pyramids & Great Sphinx Private Tour with Camel Ride - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/cfda7c2