 exploration at your own comfortable pace"]	["Skip-the-line admission ticket to Grand Egyptian Museum", "Access to all permanent exhibition galleries", "Self-guided exploration with museum map", "Access to museum facilities and amenities"]	["Professional tour guide services", "Transportation to and from the museum", "Food and beverages", "Audio guide rental", "Special exhibition access (if applicable)", "Souvenir purchases"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera (photography may be restricted in certain areas), valid ID or passport, and water bottle	Photography rules may vary by gallery. Large bags may need to be stored in lockers. The museum is wheelchair accessible with elevators and ramps throughout.	41.00	\N	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	41.00	0	["09:00", "10:00", "11:00", "12:00", "13:00", "14:00", "15:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the scheduled visit date	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Grand Egyptian Museum Main Entrance	Present your ticket at the main entrance ticketing area	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345419/rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-bff2-d8bc83a8d55d/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345419/rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-bff2-d8bc83a8d55d/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Grand Egyptian Museum Skip-the-Line Tickets - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-bff2-d8bc83a8d55d/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345421/rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-bff2-d8bc83a8d55d/1.jpg", "alt_text": "Grand Egyptian Museum Skip-the-Line Tickets - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-bff2-d8bc83a8d55d/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345423/rayna/activities/54f43b48-cf63-4a5c-