t's glorious past.	["Explore the world's largest archaeological museum dedicated to ancient Egypt", "Marvel at over 100,000 artifacts spanning 5,000 years of Egyptian civilization", "Discover priceless treasures including royal artifacts and ancient masterpieces", "Experience state-of-the-art interactive displays and multimedia presentations", "Visit galleries showcasing collections from various Egyptian dynasties", "Enjoy stunning views of the nearby Giza Pyramids from the museum grounds"]	["Entry ticket to Grand Egyptian Museum", "Access to main exhibition halls and galleries", "Self-guided exploration of permanent collections", "Access to interactive displays and multimedia features"]	["Guided tour services", "Transportation to and from the museum", "Food and beverages", "Audio guide rental", "Special exhibition access (if applicable)", "Photography permits for certain areas"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera (for permitted areas), water bottle, and sun protection for outdoor areas	The museum is located near the Giza Pyramids. Photography may be restricted in certain exhibition areas. Large bags may need to be stored in lockers.	31.00	25.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	31.00	480	["09:00", "10:00", "11:00", "12:00", "13:00", "14:00", "15:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the scheduled visit	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Grand Egyptian Museum Main Entrance	Present your ticket at the main entrance of the Grand Egyptian Museum	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345129/rayna/activities/a3c31c84-f413-408d-91f9-78b808765927/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345129/rayna/activities/a3c31c84-f413-408d-91f9-78b808765927/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Cairo: Entry Ticket to Grand Egyptian Museum - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activiti