08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f	From Cairo: Full-Day Tour to El Fayoum	from-cairo-full-day-tour-to-el-fayoum-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Day Trip	Nature	Private tour	null	enriched	Escape Cairo's bustling streets on an exclusive private journey to El Fayoum Oasis, discovering ancient wonders and pristine natural beauty.	Embark on an extraordinary private expedition from Cairo to the enchanting El Fayoum Oasis, Egypt's hidden gem nestled just southwest of the capital. This comprehensive full-day adventure transports you to one of the world's oldest agricultural regions, where ancient history seamlessly blends with stunning natural landscapes. Your expert guide will lead you through the remarkable Wadi Al-Hitan (Valley of the Whales), a UNESCO World Heritage site showcasing fossilized whale skeletons that tell the story of when this desert was once an ancient sea. Marvel at the crystalline waters of Lake Qarun, Egypt's largest saltwater lake, where migratory birds create a spectacular natural sanctuary. Explore the fascinating Wadi Al-Rayan waterfalls, a unique desert oasis where cascading waters create an otherworldly atmosphere against golden sand dunes. Visit the ancient Pyramid of Meidum, an architectural marvel predating the famous Giza pyramids, offering insights into early pyramid construction techniques. The tour includes stops at traditional Fayoumi villages where you can witness authentic Egyptian rural life and perhaps sample local delicacies. Your private vehicle ensures comfortable transportation throughout this diverse landscape, while your knowledgeable guide shares captivating stories about the region's geological significance and cultural heritage. This immersive experience offers photographers and nature enthusiasts unparalleled opportunities to capture Egypt's diverse beauty beyond the typical tourist trail, making it an essential addition to any comprehensive Egyptian adventure.	["Discover UNESCO-listed Wadi Al-Hitan with ancient whale fossils", "Experience the magical Wadi Al-Rayan desert waterfalls", "Explore Lake Qarun's pristine saltwater ecosystem", "Visit the historic Pyramid of Meidum", "Enjoy authentic village life in traditional Fayoumi communities", "Travel in comfort with private transportation and expert guide"]	["Private air-conditioned vehicle transportation", "Professional English-speaking guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Entrance fees to all mentioned sites", "Bottled water during the tour"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Meals and beverages", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and light jacket for evening return	Tour involves moderate walking on uneven terrain. Bring sun protection as desert areas offer limited shade. Best visited during cooler months.	130.00	100.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	130.00	480	["08:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before departure with full refund	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup available from Cairo and Giza hotels	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345206/rayna/activities/08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345206/rayna/activities/08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From Cairo: Full-Day Tour to El Fayoum - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345207/rayna/activities/08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f/1.jpg", "alt_text": "From Cairo: Full-Day Tour to El Fayoum - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/08e24ec0-623f-4957-b920-95c18e2e7e1f/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/u