38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840	London: Leeds Castle and Hever Castle Day Trip With Tickets	london-leeds-castle-and-hever-castle-day-trip-with-tickets-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Day Trip	Castle Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Full-day trip from London to visit two magnificent castles: Leeds Castle and Hever Castle with skip-the-line entry tickets.	Embark on an enchanting full-day journey from London to discover two of England's most magnificent castles. This comprehensive day trip takes you to the legendary Leeds Castle, known as the 'loveliest castle in the world,' and the historic Hever Castle, childhood home of Anne Boleyn. Your adventure begins with comfortable coach transport from central London, allowing you to relax and enjoy the scenic Kent countryside. At Leeds Castle, explore 900 years of history as you wander through beautifully furnished rooms, admire priceless artworks, and stroll through the stunning gardens and grounds. The castle's unique setting on two islands in a natural lake creates a truly magical atmosphere. Continue to Hever Castle, where you'll step into Tudor history at the childhood home of Henry VIII's second wife, Anne Boleyn. Discover the castle's fascinating collection of Tudor portraits, furniture, and artifacts while exploring the rooms where Anne spent her formative years. The award-winning gardens at Hever are equally impressive, featuring the Italian Garden with its classical statuary and the romantic Rose Garden. Both castles offer skip-the-line entry, ensuring you maximize your time exploring rather than waiting in queues. Your knowledgeable guide will share captivating stories and historical insights throughout the day, bringing these remarkable locations to life. This carefully curated tour provides the perfect blend of history, architecture, and natural beauty, making it an ideal day out for history enthusiasts, castle lovers, and anyone seeking to experience England's rich heritage.	["Skip the line"]	["Round-trip coach transport from London", "Skip-the-line entry tickets to Leeds Castle", "Skip-the-line entry tickets to Hever Castle", "Professional tour guide", "Free time to explore both castles independently"]	["Food and beverages", "Gratuities", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Personal expenses"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and some cash for refreshments	This tour involves moderate walking on uneven surfaces and stairs. Weather conditions may affect outdoor activities. Castles may have restricted areas during special events.	89.00	62.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	660	["08:30"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour starts	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Victoria Coach Station	Meet at Victoria Coach Station, Gate 1-5 area. Look for the tour operator's representative with company signage.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739189/rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739189/rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/0.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Leeds Castle and Hever Castle Day Trip With Tickets - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739191/rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/1.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Leeds Castle and Hever Castle Day Trip With Tickets - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739192/rayna/activities/38879a72-883b-4d75-a886-32b5078a3840/2.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Leeds Castle and Hever Castle Day Trip With Tickets - image 3", "siz