c2929644-6b9f-4ada-b2af-b9e0f727ef2c	From Hurghada: Hidden Cairo, Citadel & Cave Church Tour	from-hurghada-hidden-cairo-citadel-cave-church-tour-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Religious Sites	Group tour	null	enriched	Discover Cairo's spiritual treasures on this captivating day trip from Hurghada, exploring the historic Citadel and remarkable Cave Church.	Embark on an extraordinary spiritual and cultural journey from Hurghada to Cairo, where ancient history and religious heritage converge in spectacular fashion. This comprehensive day tour takes you beyond the typical tourist trail to explore two of Cairo's most fascinating religious landmarks.\n\nYour adventure begins with the magnificent Saladin Citadel, a medieval Islamic fortification that has dominated Cairo's skyline for over 800 years. Perched atop Mokattam Hills, this UNESCO World Heritage site offers breathtaking panoramic views of the sprawling metropolis below. Within the citadel walls, marvel at the stunning Muhammad Ali Mosque, also known as the Alabaster Mosque, with its impressive Ottoman architecture and soaring minarets that pierce the Cairo sky.\n\nNext, venture into the heart of Coptic Cairo to discover the extraordinary Cave Church of Saint Simon the Tanner, one of the world's largest churches carved directly into solid rock. This remarkable sanctuary, nestled within the Mokattam Mountain, can accommodate up to 20,000 worshippers and represents a testament to faith and human ingenuity. The church's amphitheater-like structure and stunning rock formations create an otherworldly atmosphere that leaves visitors in awe.\n\nThroughout your journey, experienced guides will share captivating stories about Egypt's rich religious diversity, from Islamic conquests to Coptic Christian traditions. You'll gain insights into how different faiths have coexisted and shaped Cairo's unique cultural landscape over millennia.\n\nThis carefully curated tour offers an intimate glimpse into Cairo's hidden spiritual gems, perfect for travelers seeking authentic cultural experiences beyond the famous pyramids. With comfortable transportation and expert guidance, you'll return to Hurghada with unforgettable memories of Egypt's remarkable religious heritage.	["Explore the medieval Saladin Citadel with panoramic city views", "Visit the stunning Muhammad Ali Mosque with its alabaster walls", "Discover the remarkable Cave Church carved into solid rock", "Learn about Egypt's diverse religious heritage from expert guides", "Experience authentic Coptic Cairo away from typical tourist crowds", "Enjoy comfortable round-trip transportation from Hurghada"]	["Round-trip transportation from Hurghada hotels", "Professional English-speaking guide", "Entrance fees to Saladin Citadel", "Entrance fees to Cave Church", "Air-conditioned vehicle transportation", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Meals and beverages", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Travel insurance", "Photography fees at certain locations"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, modest clothing for religious sites, and bottled water	This tour involves moderate walking and climbing stairs. Modest dress code required for religious sites. Photography may be restricted in certain areas.	118.00	\N	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	118.00	480	["06:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour departure time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup from your Hurghada hotel lobby	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Intermediate	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776344977/rayna/activities/c2929644-6b9f-4ada-b2af-b9e0f727ef2c/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776344977/rayna/activities/c2929644-6b9f-4ada-b2af-b9e0f727ef2c/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From Hurghada: Hidden Cairo, Citadel & Cave Church To