1b3f4c9d-4088-40ab-8b76-7ae10a7b5304	From Cairo: Half-Day Tour to Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx	from-cairo-half-day-tour-to-pyramids-of-giza-and-the-sphinx-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Historical Sites	Group tour	null	enriched	Discover Egypt's most iconic monuments on this captivating half-day journey to the legendary Pyramids of Giza and the enigmatic Sphinx.	Embark on an unforgettable adventure to witness one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World with this expertly guided half-day excursion from Cairo. Your journey begins with comfortable transportation to the Giza Plateau, where three magnificent pyramids have stood sentinel over the desert for over 4,500 years. Marvel at the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the largest and oldest of the trio, alongside the pyramids of Khafre and Menkaure, each telling tales of pharaonic power and ancient Egyptian engineering mastery. Stand in awe before the mysterious Great Sphinx, the colossal limestone guardian with a human head and lion's body that has captivated visitors for millennia. Your knowledgeable guide will share fascinating insights into the construction techniques, historical significance, and enduring mysteries surrounding these remarkable monuments. Learn about the ancient burial practices of the pharaohs and the religious beliefs that inspired these architectural marvels. The tour provides ample time for photography and exploration, allowing you to fully appreciate the scale and grandeur of these timeless structures against the backdrop of the golden desert landscape. This carefully crafted experience offers the perfect introduction to Egypt's rich heritage, combining historical education with the thrill of standing before monuments that have inspired wonder for thousands of years.	["Explore the legendary Great Pyramid of Khufu, one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World", "Encounter the mysterious Great Sphinx and learn about its ancient secrets", "Discover all three pyramids of the Giza 