6bea18ec-b9f9-4d62-9f33-cf733c8d632e	From Cairo: Desert Safari, Camel Ride, Magic Lake, & Lunch	from-cairo-desert-safari-camel-ride-magic-lake-lunch-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Adventure	Desert Safari	Group tour	null	enriched	Escape Cairo's bustling streets for an unforgettable desert adventure featuring camel rides, pristine oasis waters, and authentic Bedouin cuisine.	Embark on an extraordinary journey from Cairo into Egypt's mesmerizing desert landscape, where golden sand dunes stretch endlessly toward the horizon. This comprehensive desert safari offers the perfect blend of adventure, culture, and natural beauty, taking you far from the city's hustle into a world of serene wilderness.\n\nYour adventure begins with a scenic drive through Egypt's diverse terrain, transitioning from urban landscapes to the breathtaking expanse of the Western Desert. Upon arrival, you'll experience the timeless tradition of camel riding, swaying gently atop these magnificent desert ships as you traverse the undulating dunes. The rhythmic pace of your camel creates a meditative experience, allowing you to fully absorb the desert's profound silence and stunning vistas.\n\nThe highlight of your journey awaits at the enchanting Magic Lake, a pristine natural oasis that appears like a mirage amid the golden sands. This crystal-clear body of water offers a refreshing contrast to the surrounding arid landscape, creating perfect photo opportunities and moments of tranquil reflection. The lake's serene beauty has captivated travelers for generations, earning its mystical reputation.\n\nAs the desert sun reaches its peak, you'll savor a delicious traditional lunch prepared in authentic Bedouin style. This culinary experience showcases the rich flavors of Egyptian desert cuisine, featuring locally-sourced ingredients and time-honored cooking methods that have sustained nomadic communities for centuries.\n\nThroughout your safari, expert guides share fascinating insights into desert ecology, Bedouin culture, and the geological forces that shaped this remarkable landscape. Whether you're seeking adventure, cultural immersion, or simply a peaceful escape from modern life, this desert safari delivers an unforgettable Egyptian experience that will remain etched in your memory long after you return to Cairo.	["Journey through Egypt's stunning Western Desert landscape on a guided expedition", "Experience traditional camel riding across golden sand dunes", "Discover the magical oasis waters of the pristine Magic Lake", "Enjoy authentic Bedouin-style lunch prepared with traditional methods", "Learn about desert ecology and nomadic culture from expert local guides", "Escape Cairo's urban environment for peaceful desert tranquility", "Capture stunning photographs of dramatic desert scenery and oasis beauty"]	["Round-trip transportation from Cairo in air-conditioned vehicle", "Professional desert guide services", "Camel riding experience with safety equipment", "Traditional Bedouin-style lunch meal", "Bottled water throughout the excursion", "All entrance fees and permits"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guides and drivers", "Travel insurance coverage", "Additional beverages beyond included water", "Photography fees at certain locations"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, sunglasses, camera, light jacket for evening, and personal water bottle	Tour operates in various weather conditions. Comfortable clothing suitable for desert climate recommended. Camel riding experience suitable for most fitness levels.	118.00	95.00	\N	\N	148.00	USD	Per person	20.00	118.00	600	["08:00", "09:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before departure time for full refund	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel pickup available	Pickup from Cairo hotels and designated meeting points in city center	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	[