e578a0cd-2e84-4ce8-9ca5-20e06add5bed	Cairo Citadel, Old Cairo and Khan El Khalili: Private Tour	cairo-citadel-old-cairo-and-khan-el-khalili-private-tour-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Historical Sites	Private tour	null	enriched	Discover Cairo's most iconic treasures on this exclusive private tour featuring the magnificent Citadel, historic Old Cairo, and bustling Khan El Khalili bazaar.	Embark on an unforgettable journey through Cairo's most captivating historical landmarks with this comprehensive private tour. Your adventure begins at the imposing Citadel of Saladin, a medieval Islamic fortification that has dominated Cairo's skyline for over 800 years. Marvel at the stunning Mosque of Muhammad Ali with its distinctive Ottoman architecture and panoramic views across the sprawling metropolis.\n\nContinue to Old Cairo, where centuries of history unfold before your eyes. Explore the atmospheric Coptic Quarter, home to ancient churches and the fascinating Coptic Museum. Walk through narrow cobblestone streets where Roman, Byzantine, and Islamic civilizations have left their indelible marks. Visit the renowned Hanging Church and discover the rich Christian heritage that flourished in this sacred enclave.\n\nConclude your cultural odyssey at the legendary Khan El Khalili bazaar, Cairo's most famous marketplace that has been the heart of trade for over 600 years. Navigate through labyrinthine alleys filled with aromatic spices, handcrafted treasures, and authentic Egyptian souvenirs. Experience the vibrant energy of local merchants and immerse yourself in the timeless atmosphere of this UNESCO World Heritage site.\n\nThis private tour offers personalized attention from your expert guide, allowing you to delve deeper into Egypt's fascinating history and culture at your own pace. Perfect for history enthusiasts and culture seekers who want to experience Cairo's most significant monuments in comfort and style.	["Explore the majestic Citadel of Saladin with breathtaking city panoramas", "Discover ancient Coptic churches and religious treasures in Old Cairo", "Navigate the enchanting maze of Khan El Khalili's traditional bazaar", "Enjoy personalized commentary from your dedicated private guide", "Visit the spectacular Mosque of Muhammad Ali with its Ottoman splendor", "Experience three distinct historical periods in one comprehensive tour", "Convenient hotel pickup and drop-off included for your comfort"]	["Professional private tour guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Air-conditioned private transportation", "Entrance fees to all mentioned attractions", "Bottled water during the tour"]	["Personal expenses and shopping", "Meals and beverages", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Optional activities not mentioned in itinerary", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and modest clothing for religious sites	Modest dress code required for religious sites. Tour operates year-round but early morning start recommended during summer months.	85.00	65.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	85.00	360	["08:00", "09:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before tour departure	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup available from most Cairo and Giza hotels	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345073/rayna/activities/e578a0cd-2e84-4ce8-9ca5-20e06add5bed/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345073/rayna/activities/e578a0cd-2e84-4ce8-9ca5-20e06add5bed/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Cairo Citadel, Old Cairo and Khan El Khalili: Private Tour - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/e578a0cd-2e84-4ce8-9ca5-20e06add5bed/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345075/rayna/activities/e578a0cd-2e84-4ce8-9ca5-20e06add5bed/1.jpg", "alt_text": 