a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3	London: Buckingham Palace & Changing of the Guard Experience	london-buckingham-palace-changing-of-the-guard-experience-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Cultural	Royal Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Guided walking tour through London's royal palaces and parks, witnessing the Changing of the Guard ceremonies and exploring Westminster's millennium-old history.	Journey through London's royal palaces and verdant parks, where captivating stories await, on this walking tour. Stroll past Buckingham Palace, St. James's Palace, Clarence House, Whitehall, and Westminster Abbey. You will witness the Horse Guards Parade, an official mounted Changing of the Guard, performed by the Household Cavalry in full ceremonial uniform (takes place daily). See the iconic Foot Guards Changing of the Guard ceremony, featuring the famous red tunics and bearskin hats (takes place on Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Sunday). Discover the hidden tales of St. James's Palace, once home to the notorious King Henry VIII, and the poignant setting of King Charles I's final night before his fateful execution. Continue to Lancaster House and the world-renowned Buckingham Palace, formerly known as Buckingham House. Additionally, visit Clarence House, the official residence of His Majesty, King Charles III. Walk through Green Park, Whitehall, and Westminster Abbey, concluding near Westminster Station, conveniently located across from the iconic Big Ben.	["Discover the tales of St. James's Palace, London's most senior palace", "Embark on a guided journey through royal palaces and lush parks", "Explore Lancaster House, Buckingham Palace, and Clarence House", "Take a stroll past Green Park, Whitehall, and Westminster Abbey", "Witness the Ceremonial Changing of the King's Guard & the Horse Guard Parade"]	["Live tour guide", "Guided walking tour", "Changing of the Guard viewing (on select days)"]	["Hotel pickup and drop-off"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and umbrella if rain is expected	Changing of the Guard ceremonies may be cancelled due to weather or state events. Foot Guards ceremony occurs on Monday, Wednesday, Friday, and Sunday. Horse Guards Parade takes place daily. Tour involves approximately 2 miles of walking on paved surfaces.	25.00	18.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	120	["10:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour starts	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Santander Bank, Green Park	Please wait outside Santander Bank, where your guide awaits your arrival. If arriving by tube, exit Green Park Station and turn left onto the main road where you will find the bank directly across.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en", "fr", "es", "de"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738829/rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738829/rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/0.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Buckingham Palace & Changing of the Guard Experience - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738831/rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/1.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Buckingham Palace & Changing of the Guard Experience - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738833/rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/2.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Buckingham Palace & Changing of the Guard Experience - image 3", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/a31e28f9-dc1b-4a24-ae93-33a0cdfe4de3/2"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykb