036124b8-0ef3-4feb-9297-4e9cd4db4242	Westminster Abbey, Big Ben & Buckingham Guided Tour	westminster-abbey-big-ben-buckingham-guided-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Cultural	Walking Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Guided walking tour of London's most iconic landmarks including Westminster Abbey, Big Ben, and Buckingham Palace.	Embark on an unforgettable journey through London's most prestigious landmarks with this comprehensive guided walking tour of Westminster Abbey, Big Ben, and Buckingham Palace. This expertly curated 3.5-hour experience takes you through the heart of royal London, where centuries of British history come alive through captivating storytelling and insider knowledge.\n\nBegin your adventure at the magnificent Westminster Abbey, a UNESCO World Heritage site that has witnessed over 1,000 years of British history. Marvel at the Gothic architecture while learning about the coronations, royal weddings, and burials that have taken place within these hallowed walls. Your knowledgeable guide will share fascinating tales of monarchs, poets, and statesmen who rest here, including Elizabeth I, Charles Darwin, and Stephen Hawking.\n\nContinue to the iconic Big Ben and the Houses of Parliament, where you'll discover the workings of British democracy and the stories behind these architectural marvels. Learn about the Great Fire of 1834, the reconstruction efforts, and the intricate details of the Elizabeth Tower that houses the famous bell.\n\nThe tour culminates at Buckingham Palace, the working headquarters of the British Royal Family. Explore St. James's Park and witness the grandeur of the palace's facade while hearing captivating stories about royal traditions, state ceremonies, and the daily life of the monarchy. If timing permits, you may even witness the famous Changing of the Guard ceremony.\n\nThis immersive walking tour combines historical insights with contemporary royal life, offering a perfect introduction to London's royal heritage. Your expert guide brings these landmarks to life with engaging anecdotes, historical context, and insider tips that you won't find in guidebooks.	["Explore Westminster Abbey, a UNESCO World Heritage site with over 1,000 years of history", "Learn fascinating stories about royal coronations, weddings, and famous burials", "Discover the iconic Big Ben and Houses of Parliament with expert commentary", "Visit Buckingham Palace and learn about current royal traditions", "Enjoy insider knowledge and captivating anecdotes from your professional guide", "Walk through beautiful St. James's Park with stunning palace views", "Small group experience ensuring personalized attention", "Perfect introduction to London's royal heritage and British history"]	["Professional English-speaking guide", "3.5-hour guided walking tour", "Historical commentary and insider stories", "Small group experience", "Route through St. James's Park"]	["Westminster Abbey entrance fees", "Food and beverages", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Gratuities", "Personal expenses"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and water bottle	This is an outdoor walking tour covering approximately 2-3 miles. Westminster Abbey entrance is not included in the tour price. The Changing of the Guard ceremony is subject to weather conditions and official schedules.	35.00	25.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	210	["10:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour starts	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Westminster Abbey West Door	Meet your guide outside the West Door of Westminster Abbey, near the red telephone boxes	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738540/rayna/activities/036124b8-0ef3-4feb-9297-4e9cd4db4242/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738540/rayna/activities/0361