07e11311-f8e2-4a04-b06a-0ca6340fc01b	London: Warner Bros. Studio Harry Potter Tour with Transfers	london-warner-bros-studio-harry-potter-tour-with-transfers-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Visit the magical world of Harry Potter at Warner Bros. Studio with convenient coach transfers from central London.	Experience the magic of Harry Potter at the Warner Bros. Studio Tour London with convenient coach transfers included. This comprehensive tour takes you behind the scenes of the Harry Potter films, where you can explore authentic sets, costumes, and props. The tour includes round-trip coach transportation from a central London meeting point, making it easy to reach the studios located outside the city. You'll have either 4 or 5 hours to explore the studio at your own pace, depending on which tour option you choose. Walk through iconic locations like the Great Hall, Diagon Alley, and Platform 9¾, and discover the secrets behind the movie magic. The tour concludes with time to browse the extensive gift shop before returning to London.	["Visit the authentic Harry Potter film sets and locations", "Explore the Great Hall, Diagon Alley, and Platform 9\\u00be", "Discover original costumes, props, and special effects", "Convenient round-trip coach transfers from central London", "4-5 hours of self-guided studio exploration time", "Browse the extensive Harry Potter gift shop"]	["Round-trip coach transfers from London", "Warner Bros. Studio Tour entrance ticket", "Ticket collection assistance at the studio"]	["Food and beverages", "Souvenir purchases", "Gratuities"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera (photography allowed in most areas), and spending money for food, drinks, and souvenirs	The studio tour is entirely indoors and wheelchair accessible. Photography is permitted in most areas. Advance booking is essential as tours often sell out. The studio is located approximately 20 miles northwest of central London.	89.00	