bd253e3e-36eb-4916-a0cb-58ead0b503f8	London: Warner Bros. Studio Harry Potter Tour with Transfers (8-Hour)	london-warner-bros-studio-harry-potter-tour-with-transfers-8-hour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Extended Warner Bros. Studio Harry Potter tour with 5 hours of studio time and convenient coach transfers from central London.	Experience the magic of Harry Potter at the Warner Bros. Studio Tour London with this extended 8-hour experience including convenient coach transfers. This comprehensive tour provides you with 5 full hours to explore the studio at your own pace, giving you extra time to fully immerse yourself in the wizarding world. The tour includes round-trip coach transportation from a central London meeting point, making it easy to reach the studios located outside the city. Walk through iconic locations like the Great Hall, Diagon Alley, and Platform 9¾, and discover the secrets behind the movie magic. With the additional hour compared to the standard tour, you'll have more time to explore every detail of the authentic sets, costumes, and props used in the films. The tour concludes with time to browse the extensive gift shop before returning to London.	["Extended 5-hour studio exploration time", "Visit the authentic Harry Potter film sets and locations", "Explore the Great Hall, Diagon Alley, and Platform 9\\u00be", "Discover original costumes, props, and special effects", "Convenient round-trip coach transfers from central London", "Browse the extensive Harry Potter gift shop"]	["Round-trip coach transfers from London", "Warner Bros. Studio Tour entrance ticket", "Ticket collection assistance at the studio"]	["Food and beverages", "Souvenir purchases", "Gratuities"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera or smartphone for photos, and spending money for food, drinks, and souvenirs at the studio	The studio tour involves extensive walking and standing. Photography is allowed in most areas but flash p