190aaf41-c9e4-42cc-a61c-a12f1cba5905	From London: White Cliffs of Dover and Canterbury Day Trip	from-london-white-cliffs-of-dover-and-canterbury-day-trip-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Day Trip	Sightseeing Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Join this day tour from London and walk along the world-famous White Cliffs of Dover with spectacular coastal views. Explore Canterbury on a walking tour.	Depart London on a full-day tour to explore the southern county of Kent, known as the garden of England. Travel aboard a comfortable coach to admire the White Cliffs of Dover. Join your guide on a walking tour of Canterbury to uncover the city's fascinating history. After a morning coffee stop we arrive at the White Cliffs of Dover, with time to enjoy a coastal walk or simply take in the famous views. On a clear day, see magnificent views of the English Channel and even France. Enjoy free-time to marvel at the beauty of the White Cliffs. The visitor center offers an opportunity to get refreshments and souvenirs. We stop for 1.5 hours to allow you time to enjoy the cliff-top coastal walk. Or enjoy the beautiful views and relax at the visitor centre. We take a brief stop at Dover Seafront to walk along the seashore and get some photos of the cliffs from sea level. Continue to the historic city of Canterbury, where your guide will introduce you to the city with an informative optional walking tour. Wander amongst the ancient buildings and charming streets of this picturesque city. Take some time to visit Canterbury Cathedral if you wish, or spend longer exploring this magnificent historic city. Spend 2.5 hours in Canterbury, with time for lunch, walking tour, a cathedral visit, and free time to explore. Arrive back in London in the early evening by 5.30pm approx.	["Enjoy breath taking coastal views at the White Cliffs of Dover", "Marvel at the beautiful Kent Countryside, known as the garden of England", "Visit the picturesque city of Canterbury and enjoy an insightful walking-tour", "See magnificent views of the English Channel and even France on clear days", "Explore Canterbury Cathedral and historic city streets", "Comfortable coach transportation with knowledgeable guide", "Photo opportunities at Dover Seafront from sea level", "Free time for lunch and shopping in Canterbury"]	["Transportation by comfortable minibus", "Walking tour of Canterbury", "Visitor charges at the White Cliffs of Dover"]	["Entry to optional sites such as Cathedral", "Children under 3 years"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and some cash for optional cathedral entrance and meals	Canterbury Cathedral entrance fee is not included. Weather can change quickly at the coast, so bring layers. The tour involves moderate walking on uneven surfaces.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	600	["08:30"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour starts	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	148 Queen Victoria St, BLACKFRIARS, EC4V 4BQ	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Bus parking area along from RUDDS BAR	Meeting point is a 5 minute walk from the Blackfriars station. Meet at the Bus parking area along from RUDDS BAR. From Blackfriars Underground station, exit the station and turn right. Walk under the railway bridge and along the main street until you see Rudds bar. Our meeting point is in the bus parking area just along from Rudds bar.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738991/rayna/activities/190aaf41-c9e4-42cc-a61c-a12f1cba5905/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738991/rayna/activities/190aaf41-c9e4-42cc-a61c-a12f1cba5905/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From London: White Cliffs of Dover and Canterbury Day Trip - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/190aaf41-c9e4-42cc-a61c-a12f1cba5905/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0