d150a499-89cc-486b-8dbe-18e99576bd04	The View from The Shard	the-view-from-the-shard-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Observation Deck	Self-guided	null	draft	Experience panoramic views of London from Western Europe's tallest viewing platform on the 72nd floor of The Shard.	Watch the streets of London fall away as you climb to Western Europe's tallest viewing platform on the 72nd floor of The Shard. With a flexible ticket, spend as much time as you like enjoying panoramic views of the city, with visibility of up to 40 miles. Test your limits and step outside onto the open viewing platform on the 72nd floor, or admire the views from inside. Learn about London's history through multimedia displays and exhibits, or simply sit back and enjoy the view from the champagne bar. The Shard redefines London's skyline and will soon be a dynamic symbol of the city, recognizable throughout the world. The unique building features a sculpted design of glass facets that incline inward without meeting at the top to allow the building to breathe naturally. Sneak a glance upward at the points of glass that form the top of the building, which reaches a height of 1,016 feet (310 meters). Finish up your journey in the boutique, where you can purchase a souvenir photograph.	["Visit Western Europe's tallest viewing platform", "Enjoy panoramic views with visibility up to 40 miles", "Step outside onto the open viewing platform on the 72nd floor", "Learn about London's history through multimedia displays", "Relax at the champagne bar with stunning views", "Experience the unique glass architecture of The Shard", "Purchase souvenir photographs at the boutique"]	["Access to the 72nd floor viewing platform", "Multimedia displays and exhibits", "Access to champagne bar", "Flexible timing"]	["Food and beverages (available for purchase)", "Souvenir photographs (available for purchase)", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Guided tour commentary"]	Comfortable shoes, camera, warm clot