f7d1ecc1-b7fb-4361-8819-e748501f0ddd	From London: Harry Potter Warner Bros Studio Tour	from-london-harry-potter-warner-bros-studio-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Explore the magic of Harry Potter films with behind-the-scenes access to sets, costumes, and props at Warner Bros Studio Tour London.	Perfect for those with a penchant for Harry Potter, this Warner Bros. Studio Tour in London provides a unique opportunity to explore the magic of the Harry Potter films — the most successful movie series of all time. Venture behind the scenes to discover a huge array of fantastic sets, costumes, and props. Learn some closely guarded secrets, including facts about the special effects and animatronics that made the Harry Potter films so hugely popular around the world. Step onto the famous cobblestones of Diagon Alley, featuring the shopfronts of Ollivander's Wand Shop, Flourish and Blotts, and Weasleys' Wizard Wheezes. See iconic props from the films, including Harry's Nimbus 2000 and Hagrid's motorcycle. Rediscover other memorable sets from the film series, including the Gryffindor common room, the boys' dormitory, Hagrid's hut, and the Potions classroom. Visit Platform 9 ¾ and ride the Hogwarts Express! For the first time ever, enter the set of Gringotts Wizarding Bank and walk through the wizarding bank, the Lestrange vault, and a gallery of goblins.	["Step onto the famous cobblestones of Diagon Alley", "See iconic props including Harry's Nimbus 2000 and Hagrid's motorcycle", "Visit Platform 9 \\u00be and ride the Hogwarts Express", "Enter the set of Gringotts Wizarding Bank for the first time ever", "Explore the Gryffindor common room and boys' dormitory", "Discover the Lestrange vault and gallery of goblins", "Learn about special effects and animatronics", "Browse through your favorite character's luggage"]	["Bus journey to and from Warner Bros Studio", "Approximately 4 hours at the Harry Potter studio", "A