largest crowds while allowing you to return to London with the afternoon free for other activities. The experience combines education with wonder, making it suitable for history enthusiasts, families, and anyone curious about Britain's ancient past. Professional guides ensure you gain maximum insight into this remarkable site while comfortable transportation makes the journey as enjoyable as the destination.	["Skip the line", "Optional audio guide"]	["Round-trip coach transportation from London", "Full admission ticket to Stonehenge", "Access to visitor center and exhibitions", "Professional tour guide", "Comfortable air-conditioned coach"]	["Audio guide (available for additional fee)", "Food and beverages", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Gratuities", "Personal expenses"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and water bottle. Dress in layers as weather can change quickly.	The tour operates in all weather conditions. Stonehenge is an outdoor monument with limited shelter. Audio guides are available in multiple languages for an additional fee. The stone circle is viewed from a pathway approximately 10 meters from the stones.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	390	["08:30", "09:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour departure time for a full refund.	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Victoria Coach Station	Meet at Victoria Coach Station, Gate 1-5. Please arrive 15 minutes before departure time for check-in.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739878/rayna/activities/cf99b963-af4a-4870-9399-f9787a1757eb/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775739878/rayna/activities/cf99b963-af4a-4870-9399-f9787a1757eb/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From London: Stonehenge Morning Day Trip with Admission - image 1", "size_variant": "detail"