87018415-3b8b-4f06-b25a-5d7c06d7619c	London: Seven Sisiters Brighton Beach Chinese Day Tour	london-seven-sisiters-brighton-beach-chinese-day-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Day Trip	Nature & Coastal	Group tour	null	draft	Chinese-language day tour from London to Seven Sisters cliffs and Brighton Beach with specialized Chinese guide service.	Embark on an unforgettable Chinese-language day tour from London to explore two of England's most spectacular coastal destinations: the iconic Seven Sisters cliffs and vibrant Brighton Beach. This carefully curated tour offers Chinese-speaking travelers the perfect opportunity to discover the natural beauty of the English coastline with expert local guidance in their native language.\n\nYour journey begins with comfortable coach transport from central London, taking you through the picturesque English countryside to the stunning Seven Sisters cliffs. These magnificent white chalk cliffs rise dramatically from the English Channel, offering breathtaking panoramic views and countless photo opportunities. Your knowledgeable Chinese-speaking guide will share fascinating insights about the geological formation, local wildlife, and historical significance of this protected area within the South Downs National Park.\n\nAfter exploring the Seven Sisters, continue to the vibrant seaside resort of Brighton, famous for its pebble beach, historic pier, and eclectic atmosphere. Stroll along the famous Brighton Beach, visit the iconic Brighton Palace Pier with its traditional amusements, and explore the charming Lanes district filled with unique shops, cafes, and restaurants. The tour provides ample free time to enjoy fish and chips by the sea, browse the local markets, or simply relax on the beach while soaking in the quintessentially British seaside atmosphere.\n\nThis tour is specifically designed for Chinese-speaking visitors, ensuring clear communication and cultural context throughout the day. The specialized guide service eliminates language barriers and provides deeper understanding of British coastal culture, local traditions, and historical background. With comfortable transportation, expert guidance, and carefully planned itinerary, this tour offers an authentic English coastal experience tailored for Chinese travelers seeking to explore beyond London's city limits.	["Spectacular views of the iconic Seven Sisters white chalk cliffs", "Professional Chinese-speaking guide throughout the tour", "Visit to vibrant Brighton Beach and historic Brighton Pier", "Comfortable coach transportation from central London", "Free time to explore Brighton's famous Lanes shopping district", "Photo opportunities at England's most photographed cliffs", "Traditional English seaside experience with cultural insights"]	["Round-trip coach transportation from London", "Professional Chinese-speaking tour guide", "Guided tour of Seven Sisters cliffs area", "Free time in Brighton for independent exploration", "Commentary about local history and culture"]	["Food and beverages", "Personal expenses and shopping", "Brighton Pier attraction fees", "Travel insurance", "Gratuities for guide and driver"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, sunscreen, and spending money for meals and souvenirs	This tour is conducted primarily in Chinese language. Weather conditions may affect cliff viewing opportunities. Brighton can be busy during peak season.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	690	["08:00", "08:30"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Central London pickup point	Specific pickup location will be confirmed upon booking, typically near major hotels or transport hubs in central London	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["zh"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740038/rayna/activities/870