d8c5fad5-7ed8-4c07-be1e-80d1cfff777e	From London: Brighton & Seven Sisters Small-Group Tour	from-london-brighton-seven-sisters-small-group-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Day Trip	Nature & Coastal	Group tour	null	draft	Small group day tour from London to Brighton seaside resort and the dramatic Seven Sisters chalk cliffs.	Escape the bustling streets of London on this captivating small-group day tour to England's stunning south coast. Journey through the picturesque English countryside to discover two of the region's most beloved destinations: the vibrant seaside resort of Brighton and the breathtaking Seven Sisters chalk cliffs.\n\nYour adventure begins with a scenic drive through the rolling hills of the South Downs, offering glimpses of quintessential English landscapes. First, explore Brighton, the 'London by the Sea,' where Victorian elegance meets modern seaside charm. Stroll along the famous Brighton Pier with its vintage amusements, browse the eclectic shops in The Lanes' narrow medieval streets, and admire the exotic architecture of the Royal Pavilion. The city's pebble beach and vibrant seafront promenade provide the perfect backdrop for memorable photos.\n\nNext, venture to the Seven Sisters Country Park, home to the iconic Seven Sisters cliffs - a series of stunning white chalk cliffs that rise dramatically from the English Channel. These natural monuments offer some of the most spectacular coastal views in England, stretching across the South Downs National Park. Walk along the cliff-top paths for panoramic vistas of the coastline, or explore the visitor center to learn about the area's unique geology and wildlife.\n\nThis small-group experience ensures personalized attention from your knowledgeable guide, who will share fascinating stories about the region's history, from ancient settlements to wartime significance. The intimate group size allows for flexibility in the itinerary and opportunities to discover hidden gems that larger tours might miss.\n\nWhether you're seeking natural beauty, cultural experiences, or simply a refreshing break from city life, this tour perfectly combines coastal charm with dramatic landscapes, creating an unforgettable English countryside experience.	["Small group"]	["Round-trip transportation from London in comfortable vehicle", "Professional English-speaking guide", "Small group experience (maximum 16 people)", "Free time to explore Brighton and Seven Sisters independently", "Commentary on local history and attractions"]	["Food and drinks", "Entrance fees to attractions (Royal Pavilion, Brighton Pier rides)", "Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, sunscreen, and some cash for personal purchases and meals.	This tour involves moderate walking on uneven coastal paths. Weather conditions can change quickly at the coast, so dress in layers. The tour operates in most weather conditions.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	540	["08:30", "09:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time for a full refund.	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Victoria Coach Station	Meet at Victoria Coach Station, Gate 1-5 area. Look for your guide holding a sign with the tour company name.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740080/rayna/activities/d8c5fad5-7ed8-4c07-be1e-80d1cfff777e/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740080/rayna/activities/d8c5fad5-7ed8-4c07-be1e-80d1cfff777e/0.jpg", "alt_text": "From London: Brighton & Seven Sisters Small-Group Tour - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/d8c5fad5-7ed8-4c07-be1e-80d1cfff777e/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740082/rayna/activi