5d78e2b6-3be3-41c4-acf5-823b98e9351d	London: Westminster Abbey, Big Ben & Buckingham Guided Tour	london-westminster-abbey-big-ben-buckingham-guided-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Cultural	Historical Tour	Group tour	null	draft	3- or 4-hour walking tour of Central London with Westminster Abbey access and royal history exploration.	Join us on a 3- or 4-hour walking tour of Central London with 2 different options to experience Westminster Abbey's spiritual ambiance: as a city tour with skip-the-line access or a free organ recital / evensong at the Abbey. Discover London's royal history, highlights and hidden gems with Rosotravel - the Official Partner of Westminster Abbey. Reserve your spot on a royal voyage through time! 4-hour: Skip-the-line Westminster Abbey & City Highlights Tour: Book a 4-hour walking tour of London with Skip-the-Line Tickets to Westminster Abbey and feel history come alive through captivating storytelling. While many tours skip a guided tour inside the Abbey, our Licensed Guide will walk you through its soaring Gothic architecture, old cloisters and hidden chapels, while sharing unforgettable tales of monarchs and monumental events that took place here over the centuries. Admire the famous Coronation Chair, royal tombs, Scientists monuments, Poet's corner and so much more. No long queues, no stress—just smooth access to one of London's most iconic landmarks! From there, continue on a royal walk through Central London and see the iconic Big Ben overlooking the Houses of Parliament, the gilded gates of Buckingham Palace in St James Park, and other highlights of the City of Westminster. If you're lucky, you might even catch a glimpse of the Changing of the Guard ceremony (only on selected mornings, subject to schedule). 3-hour: Abbey Free Organ Recital or Evensong + City Highlights Tour: Prefer more flexibility? Choose the 3-hour walking tour of Central London, packed with fascinating sights, stories, and legends. Your Licensed Guide will take you through the heart of London's political and royal district, revealing the history behind Big Ben, Parliament, Buckingham Palace and other iconic landmarks. At the end of your walking tour of the City, you'll have the option to join an unforgettable organ recital (Sundays only), evensong or evening mass at Westminster Abbey on your own, without the guide.	["Skip-the-line access to Westminster Abbey", "Licensed guide inside the Abbey", "See Coronation Chair and royal tombs", "Visit Big Ben and Houses of Parliament", "Explore Buckingham Palace area", "Possible Changing of the Guard viewing", "Choice of 3-hour or 4-hour tour options"]	["Skip-the-line Westminster Abbey tickets (4-hour option)", "Licensed guide", "Walking tour of Central London"]	["Food and beverages", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Gratuities", "Westminster Abbey entrance fee (3-hour tour option)", "Transportation between sites"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera, and water bottle. Note that Westminster Abbey has a strict dress code - shoulders and knees must be covered.	Westminster Abbey has security screening similar to airports. Large bags and photography inside the Abbey are not permitted. The Changing of the Guard ceremony is subject to weather conditions and official schedules. Organ recitals are only available on Sundays.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	240	["09:30", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time for a full refund.	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Westminster Underground Station	Meet outside Westminster Underground Station, Exit 1 (Big Ben exit). Look for the guide holding a sign with the tour company name.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://cdn.getyourguide.com/image/format=auto,fit=crop,gravity=auto,quality=60,width=285,height=160/tour_img/afb4709d75bbb872d2b3ff2c74a2e