d1025b74-3b59-427a-9acf-700f0c0e37da	Ghosts of Theatreland: Haunted West End Walking Tour	ghosts-of-theatreland-haunted-west-end-walking-tour-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Ghost Tour	Self-guided	null	draft	Self-guided audio walking tour through London's West End revealing dark history and ghost stories behind famous theatres and entertainment venues.	Step into London's West End with this immersive self-guided audio walking tour that reveals the darker history hidden beneath Theatreland's glamorous facade. From Leicester Square to Covent Garden, Drury Lane to the Royal Opera House, you'll explore one of the world's most famous entertainment districts while hearing chilling accounts of actors who died violently, real-life murders between rival performers, strange figures in theatre shadows, and unexplained disturbances reported by backstage workers. This cinematic audio experience plays like a film in your ears as you walk through real locations where these stories occurred. The approximately one-mile route follows a smooth, walkable path through central London, blending documented history with reported supernatural encounters to build a steady sense of unease. You control the experience completely - start whenever you want, pause at any time, and move at your own pace. Access remains active for seven days after first use, and all stops take place outdoors in publicly accessible areas.	["Explore London's famous West End Theatreland", "Hear ghost stories and dark history of iconic venues", "Self-guided audio tour with complete control over pace", "Visit Leicester Square, Covent Garden, and Drury Lane", "Cinematic audio experience designed like a film", "One-mile walkable route through central London", "Access active for seven days after first use", "No app download required - browser-based tour"]	["Self-guided audio tour", "Seven days access after first use", "Browser-based tour (no app download needed)", "Password and instructions after boo