-tour-t1281117/?ranking_uuid=ea3ad136-9b88-4ef2-a24b-b1e1602cf902	apify	\N	f	d8f41b36beacc1c9240abe2fb6557120	76	2026-04-09 17:38:53.897838+05:30	2026-04-09 18:45:15.637023+05:30
d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607	London Gangster Tour: The Kray Twins	london-gangster-tour-the-kray-twins-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Cultural	Historical Walking Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Step into the 1960s underworld and uncover the chilling true story of Ronnie and Reggie Kray on this immersive walking tour through London's East End.	Step into the 1960s underworld and uncover the chilling true story of Ronnie and Reggie Kray. On this immersive tour, you'll bypass the usual tourist routes to walk the very pavements where the "Firm" built their empire. Discover how two brothers from Bethnal Green became the most feared men in Britain, balancing lives as brutal gangsters and high-society celebrities. Stand on the exact spot where history was made at the legendary Blind Beggar pub, visit Fort Vallance - the twins' fortified family home, explore the iconic Repton Boxing Club, and discover secret meeting points like The Carpenter's Arms. This isn't just a history lesson; it's a dive into London's dark folklore, led by expert storytellers who reveal the unspoken details the newspapers were too scared to print.	["Visit the legendary Blind Beggar pub where Ronnie Kray executed George Cornell", "Explore Fort Vallance - the twins' fortified family home", "See the iconic Repton Boxing Club where the twins honed their violence", "Discover secret meeting points like The Carpenter's Arms", "Walk the exact pavements where 'The Firm' built their criminal empire", "Learn about the East End code of silence and hidden stories", "Hear unspoken details the newspapers were too scared to print"]	["Expert local guide with extensive Kray twins knowledge", "Walking tour through historic East End locations", "Access to key Kray-related sites and landmarks", "Fascinating stories and historical insights", "Small group experience for personalized attention"]	["Food and drinks", "Transportation to meeting point", "Gratuities for guide", "Personal expenses", "Entry fees to any paid attractions"]	Comfortable walking shoes, weather-appropriate clothing, camera for photos, and a sense of adventure for exploring London's darker history.	This tour covers mature themes including violence and criminal activity. The walking route covers approximately 2-3 miles through the East End. Some locations may be viewed from the exterior only.	25.00	18.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	0	["14:00", "18:30"]	["Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time for a full refund.	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Bethnal Green Underground Station	Meet outside the main entrance of Bethnal Green Underground Station on Cambridge Heath Road. Look for your guide with a Kray Twins tour sign.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740541/rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740541/rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/0.jpg", "alt_text": "London Gangster Tour: The Kray Twins - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740544/rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/1.jpg", "alt_text": "London Gangster Tour: The Kray Twins - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740546/rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/2.jpg", "alt_text": "London Gangster Tour: The Kray Twins - image 3", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/2"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740548/rayna/activities/d59d4343-4786-4d81-9935-aa700fdfe607/3.jpg", "alt_text": "London Ga