0205b301-a0e0-472a-839d-88899ae3ce37	Harry Potter Studios & Private Transfer from Central London	harry-potter-studios-private-transfer-from-central-london-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Private tour	null	draft	Enchanting day trip to Warner Bros. Studios with entrance tickets and round-trip private transfer from London to explore the magical world of Harry Potter.	Go on an enchanting journey into the world of "Harry Potter" on a day trip from London to the Warner Bros. Studios, including entrance tickets and round-trip transfer from London. Make your way to the studios by private transportation from central London, and on arrival discover all the secrets of your favorite "Harry Potter" saga. Enter an alternate world as you walk around Diagon Alley. See stores such as Flourish and Blotts or Ollivanders Wand Shop. Go to Hogwarts and see the Great Hall, Dumbledor's office, and the Gryffindor rooms. Marvel at Platform 9¾ and the Hogwarts Express. Learn how the special effects work, and admire costumes and props that made the films feel so real. Before you go back to the world of the Muggles, enjoy a "butterbeer," or purchase some souvenirs at the studio shop.	["Private transportation from central London", "Entrance tickets to Warner Bros. Studios included", "Walk around Diagon Alley and visit iconic shops", "Explore Hogwarts Great Hall and Dumbledore's office", "See Platform 9\\u00be and the Hogwarts Express", "Learn about special effects and see authentic costumes", "Enjoy butterbeer and shop for souvenirs"]	["Round-trip private transfer from central London", "Entrance tickets to Warner Bros. Studios"]	["Food and beverages (available for purchase at the studio)", "Souvenir purchases", "Gratuities for driver", "Hotel pickup and drop-off (central London locations only)"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera for photos, and spending money for food, drinks, and souvenirs at the studio	The studio tour involves extensive walking and standin