a44c1fc3-d438-4dce-972d-6df8cfcb52a0	London: Warner Bros. Studio Tour & Round-trip Train Ticket	london-warner-bros-studio-tour-round-trip-train-ticket-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Self-guided	null	draft	Take a magical journey to Warner Bros. Studio Tour London with round-trip train tickets from London Euston. Explore the world of Harry Potter independently.	Immerse yourself in the magical world of Harry Potter at Warner Bros. Studio Tour London with this convenient package including round-trip train tickets from London Euston Station. Travel comfortably to Watford Junction and then to the studio located in Leavesden, Watford. This is a self-guided experience where you'll explore the studio independently, discovering authentic sets, costumes, and props from the Harry Potter films. The package includes flexible return train travel, allowing you to spend as much time as you want at the studio. Upon arrival at the studio, simply present your Warner Bros. voucher at reception to exchange for your entry ticket. Multiple departure times are available throughout the day, with corresponding studio entry times clearly scheduled.	["Round-trip train tickets from London Euston included", "Self-guided exploration of Warner Bros. Studio Tour London", "Flexible return train times", "Multiple departure times available", "Access to authentic Harry Potter sets, costumes, and props"]	["Warner Bros. Studio Tour London entrance ticket", "Round-trip train ticket from London Euston to Watford Junction"]	["Audio guide rental (available for additional fee)", "Food and beverages (available for purchase at studio)", "Souvenir shop purchases", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Gratuities", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera or smartphone for photos, valid photo ID, printed or mobile voucher, and weather-appropriate clothing for outdoor areas	Studio entry times are pre-scheduled and cannot be changed on the day. Arrive at the studio at leas