a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1	London: Warner Bros. Studio Tour with Hotel Pickup	london-warner-bros-studio-tour-with-hotel-pickup-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Entertainment	Studio Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Visit Warner Bros. Studio Tour London and explore iconic Harry Potter sets including Diagon Alley, the Great Hall, and Platform 9¾ with convenient hotel pickup.	Visit Warner Bros. Studio Tour London and stroll the famous cobbles of Diagon Alley, see iconic props from the film series, and explore sites like the Great Hall and Platform 9¾. Learn about the special effects used during filming and enjoy convenient pick-up and drop-off at your hotel. Explore the Forbidden Forest and rediscover other memorable sets including the Great Hall, Gryffindor Common Room, boys' dormitory, Hagrid's hut and the Potions classroom. See the latest addition: Gringotts Wizarding Bank with towering marble pillars, crystal chandeliers, and costumes belonging to goblin bankers. Enter the depths of the Lestrange vault used to store treasures including the Sword of Gryffindor and Helga Hufflepuff's Cup. The tour features seasonal exhibitions including Magical Mischief, Summer Features celebrating 25 years of Harry Potter, Dark Arts with Death Eaters' procession, and Hogwarts in the Snow transforming the Great Hall into the Yule Ball.	["Explore iconic Harry Potter sets including Diagon Alley and the Great Hall", "Visit Platform 9\\u00be and take photos with the trolley", "See the new Gringotts Wizarding Bank with marble pillars and crystal chandeliers", "Enter the Lestrange vault and see Voldemort's Horcruxes", "Explore the Forbidden Forest and Hagrid's hut", "Learn about special effects used during filming", "Experience seasonal exhibitions throughout the year", "Convenient hotel pickup and drop-off included"]	["Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Warner Bros. Studio Tour admission", "Access to all sets and exhibitions"]	["Food and beverages (available for purchase at the studio)", "Souvenir purchases at the gift shop", "Digital guide (available for additional fee)", "Gratuities for driver and guide", "Hotel pickup from locations outside central London"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera for photos, and spending money for souvenirs and refreshments at the studio cafe and gift shop.	The studio tour involves extensive walking and standing. Photography is allowed in most areas except the cinema. The tour operates rain or shine as most attractions are indoors. Advance booking is essential as tours frequently sell out.	89.00	62.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	0	["09:00", "10:00", "11:00", "12:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time. No refunds for cancellations made less than 24 hours in advance.	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	Central London Hotel Pickup	Pickup available from most central London hotels. Exact pickup time and location will be confirmed 24 hours before the tour date.	\N	t	\N	t	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740736/rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740736/rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/0.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Warner Bros. Studio Tour with Hotel Pickup - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740738/rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/1.jpg", "alt_text": "London: Warner Bros. Studio Tour with Hotel Pickup - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775740740/rayna/activities/a702f0d7-896e-496d-ac33-41713122ade1/2.jpg", "alt_te