e74d9edb-250e-47de-9815-2aa527a4962b	London: Guided Sightseeing Tour on a Vintage Open-Top Bus	london-guided-sightseeing-tour-on-a-vintage-open-top-bus-london-1	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Day Trip	Guided Bus Tour	Group tour	null	draft	90-minute guided tour of London's essential landmarks aboard an iconic 1960s Routemaster bus.	Discover London's most essential sights and landmarks in style on this guided, 90-minute "Round London Sightseeing Tour" aboard an iconic 1960s Routemaster bus specially converted to open top. Learn about the sights like Westminster, the Tower of London, and Piccadilly Circus along the way with the help of our informative tour guide. This panoramic tour passes by the "must see" landmarks of London and is a great way to see the city for those with time constraints or tourists on a budget. You don't need to spend all day hopping on & off buses to give you a flavour for the city with this tour. You'll see the Royal Courts of Justice, St.Paul's Cathedral, Monument, Tower of London, Tower Bridge, the London Eye, Big Ben & Parliament buildings, Westminster Abbey, 10 Downing Street & Whitehall, Trafalgar Square and Piccadilly Circus.	["Iconic 1960s Routemaster bus", "90-minute guided panoramic tour", "Westminster and Tower of London", "St. Paul's Cathedral and Tower Bridge", "London Eye and Big Ben", "Trafalgar Square and Piccadilly Circus", "Budget-friendly option", "Perfect for time-constrained visitors"]	["90-minute guided bus tour", "Live tour guide commentary", "Vintage Routemaster bus experience"]	["Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Food and beverages", "Entrance fees to attractions", "Gratuities for guide", "Personal expenses"]	Comfortable clothing suitable for weather conditions, camera for photos, and warm layers as the open-top bus can be breezy	Tour operates in most weather conditions. The bus is open-top so dress appropriately for the weather. Tour may be subject to traffic conditions and route variations.	35.00	25.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Pe