2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724	London: British Museum Guided Tour with Priority Entrance	london-british-museum-guided-tour-with-priority-entrance-london	c5cda0a7-0b95-4a26-a8b4-1001b81014a5	Cultural	Museum Tour	Group tour	null	draft	Join an unforgettable 2-hour journey through the British Museum with expert guides exploring fascinating exhibits and stories.	Join us for an unforgettable 2 hours journey through the British Museum, where history comes alive. Our expert guides will lead you through the museum's most fascinating exhibits, offering insights and stories you won't find anywhere else. Discover the most important and interesting artefacts of the British Museum with a experienced guide, and marvel at one of the world's oldest and finest museums in the world. There is so much to see, you could spend weeks at the British Museum and still not discover it all, with over 8 million artefacts, displayed in over 70 galleries. With our expert guides you will experience the best of the British Museum's collections, starting with a view of the breath-taking ceiling. Admire the spectacular glass roof of the Great Court, marvel at the Parthenon Sculptures, step back in time to the land of the pharaohs with Egyptian mummies, discover the secrets of the Rosetta Stone, experience the Enlightenment Room, admire the exquisite Chinese collection, and discover the treasures of Anglo-Saxon England with the Sutton Hoo ship burial.	["Priority entrance to the British Museum", "Expert guide with insights and stories", "View the spectacular glass roof of the Great Court", "Marvel at the Parthenon Sculptures (Elgin Marbles)", "Explore Egyptian mummies and the Rosetta Stone", "Visit the Enlightenment Room", "Admire Chinese and Southeast Asian collections", "Discover Anglo-Saxon treasures including Sutton Hoo ship burial"]	["Priority entrance to British Museum", "Expert guided tour", "Access to major galleries and collections"]	["Food and beverages", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Access to special exhibitions (additional fees may apply)", "Personal expenses", "Gratuities for guide"]	Comfortable walking shoes, camera (photography permitted in most areas), water bottle, and weather-appropriate clothing	The British Museum is a large venue with extensive walking required. Some galleries may be closed for maintenance without prior notice. Photography is permitted in most areas but flash photography and tripods are not allowed.	35.00	25.00	\N	\N	\N	GBP	Per person	\N	0.00	120	["10:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time	\N	\N	\N	United Kingdom	London	\N	London	0.000000	0.000000	\N	British Museum Main Entrance	Meet your guide at the main entrance of the British Museum on Great Russell Street. Look for the guide holding a sign with the tour company name.	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738867/rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738867/rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/0.jpg", "alt_text": "London: British Museum Guided Tour with Priority Entrance - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738869/rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/1.jpg", "alt_text": "London: British Museum Guided Tour with Priority Entrance - image 2", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/1"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1775738870/rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d43-a363-1a33e3fc0724/2.jpg", "alt_text": "London: British Museum Guided Tour with Priority Entrance - image 3", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/2f219ffd-ed91-4d