6cc71abf-4178-408d-b318-0ba8db4039cc	Grand Egyptian Museum & Khan El Khalili Bazaar Guided Tour	grand-egyptian-museum-khan-el-khalili-bazaar-guided-tour-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Museum Tour	Group tour	null	enriched	Discover ancient treasures at the Grand Egyptian Museum and immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of Khan El Khalili's historic bazaar.	Embark on an extraordinary journey through Egypt's most captivating cultural treasures with this comprehensive guided tour combining two of Cairo's premier destinations. Begin your adventure at the magnificent Grand Egyptian Museum, home to the world's most extensive collection of ancient Egyptian artifacts. Marvel at thousands of priceless relics spanning over 5,000 years of pharaonic history, including stunning treasures from Tutankhamun's tomb and colossal statues that tell the story of this remarkable civilization.\n\nYour expert guide will bring ancient Egypt to life as you explore the museum's state-of-the-art galleries, sharing fascinating insights about the pharaohs, their beliefs, and daily life in ancient times. Witness the incredible craftsmanship of golden jewelry, intricate sarcophagi, and sacred artifacts that have survived millennia.\n\nAfter immersing yourself in ancient history, venture into the bustling heart of Islamic Cairo at Khan El Khalili Bazaar, a labyrinthine marketplace that has been the center of trade for over 600 years. Navigate through narrow alleyways filled with aromatic spices, handcrafted souvenirs, traditional textiles, and gleaming brass lanterns. Experience the authentic atmosphere as local merchants showcase their wares, from precious jewelry and perfumes to intricate woodwork and colorful ceramics.\n\nThis cultural odyssey offers the perfect blend of ancient wonder and contemporary Egyptian life, providing unforgettable memories and deep insights into the rich heritage that makes Cairo one of the world's most fascinating destinations.	["Explore the world's largest collection of ancient Egyptian artifacts at the Grand Egyptian Museum", "Discover priceless treasures from Tutankhamun's tomb with expert commentary", "Wander through the historic Khan El Khalili Bazaar's atmospheric alleyways", "Experience authentic Egyptian culture and traditional craftsmanship", "Enjoy convenient hotel pickup and priority museum access", "Learn fascinating stories about pharaohs and ancient Egyptian civilization"]	["Professional English-speaking guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Priority entrance tickets to Grand Egyptian Museum", "Transportation in air-conditioned vehicle", "Guided tour of Khan El Khalili Bazaar"]	["Personal expenses and shopping purchases", "Meals and beverages", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Entry to special exhibitions requiring additional fees"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, camera, and cash for shopping at the bazaar	The Grand Egyptian Museum may have specific photography restrictions in certain areas. Modest dress is recommended when visiting the bazaar area.	80.00	60.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	80.00	360	["09:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup from Cairo and Giza hotels	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345259/rayna/activities/6cc71abf-4178-408d-b318-0ba8db4039cc/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345259/rayna/activities/6cc71abf-4178-408d-b318-0ba8db4039cc/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Grand Egyptian Museum & Khan El Khalili Bazaar Guided Tour - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayna/activities/6cc71abf-4178-408d-b318-0ba8db4039cc/0"}, {"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345260/rayna/activities/6cc71abf-4178-408d-b318-0ba8db4039cc/1.jpg", "alt_tex