 while convenient transportation eliminates any travel concerns.\n\nReturn to Cairo refreshed and rejuvenated, carrying memories of one of Egypt's most beautiful natural environments. This coastal adventure perfectly complements any Egyptian itinerary, offering a delightful contrast to the country's archaeological marvels.	["Journey from Cairo to Egypt's stunning Red Sea coastline", "Relax on pristine beaches with crystal-clear turquoise waters", "Enjoy swimming and water activities in the mineral-rich Red Sea", "Savor a delicious traditional lunch with coastal views", "Experience convenient round-trip transportation from Cairo", "Discover one of the world's most beautiful marine environments"]	["Round-trip transportation from Cairo", "Professional tour guide", "Traditional lunch meal", "Beach access and facilities", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Water sports equipment rental", "Additional food and beverages", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Travel insurance"]	Swimwear, sunscreen, towel, comfortable clothing, sunglasses, hat, and camera	Bring sun protection as the Red Sea area has intense sunlight. Swimming ability recommended for water activities. Comfortable walking shoes suggested for beach areas.	63.00	50.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	63.00	600	["07:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour departure time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel lobby	Pickup available from most Cairo hotels	\N	t	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345232/rayna/activities/296894c6-ae91-4e71-80d9-6a93f80f2f0c/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345232/rayna/activities/296894c6-ae91-4e71-80d9-6a93f80f2f0c/0.jpg", "alt_text": "Cairo: Day Tour to the Red Sea with Lunch - image 1", "size_variant": "detail", "cloudinary_id": "rayn