14f39559-f78a-4417-9776-c0c9584dae70	1 Day tour to Alexandria from Cairo	1-day-tour-to-alexandria-from-cairo-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Day Trip	Historical Sites	Private tour	null	enriched	Discover Alexandria's ancient wonders and modern marvels on this comprehensive private day tour from Cairo, exploring Egypt's legendary Mediterranean pearl.	Embark on an unforgettable journey to Alexandria, Egypt's captivating Mediterranean jewel, where ancient history seamlessly blends with contemporary culture. This exclusive private day tour from Cairo offers travelers the perfect opportunity to explore one of the world's most historically significant cities in comfort and style.\n\nYour adventure begins with the fascinating underground necropolis known as the Catacombs of Kom el Shoqafa, a remarkable fusion of Egyptian, Greek, and Roman architectural styles that represents one of the Seven Wonders of the Medieval World. Marvel at the intricate carvings and mysterious chambers that tell stories of Alexandria's multicultural past.\n\nContinue to the magnificent Bibliotheca Alexandrina, a stunning modern tribute to the legendary ancient Library of Alexandria. This architectural masterpiece houses millions of books and serves as a cultural beacon for the Mediterranean region. Explore its impressive halls and discover how this institution continues the legacy of ancient Alexandria's scholarly traditions.\n\nWitness the grandeur of the Roman Amphitheatre, Alexandria's only surviving Roman theater, where gladiators once entertained crowds and cultural performances still echo through time. The well-preserved marble seating and intricate mosaics offer glimpses into the city's glorious Roman period.\n\nYour tour culminates at the towering Pompey's Pillar, an imposing granite column that stands as Alexandria's most famous ancient monument. Rising majestically above the city, this impressive structure provides panoramic views and serves as a testament to the city's enduring legacy.\n\nWith convenient transportation and expert guidance throughout the day, you'll return to Cairo enriched by Alexandria's timeless beauty and profound historical significance.	["Explore the mysterious underground chambers of Kom el Shoqafa's ancient catacombs", "Visit the spectacular modern Bibliotheca Alexandrina and its vast collections", "Discover the well-preserved Roman Amphitheatre with its stunning marble architecture", "Stand beneath the magnificent Pompey's Pillar, Alexandria's iconic ancient monument", "Enjoy personalized attention with a private guide throughout your journey", "Experience seamless round-trip transportation from Cairo", "Immerse yourself in Alexandria's unique blend of ancient and contemporary culture", "Capture unforgettable photos at each historically significant location"]	["Private air-conditioned vehicle transportation", "Professional English-speaking tour guide", "All entrance fees to mentioned attractions", "Bottled water during the tour", "Hotel pickup and drop-off in Cairo"]	["Lunch and refreshments", "Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Travel insurance", "Any services not specifically mentioned"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, and a light jacket for evening return	Tour duration is approximately 10 hours including travel time. Comfortable walking is required at archaeological sites. Photography may be restricted in certain areas.	24.00	18.00	\N	\N	30.00	USD	Per person	20.00	24.00	600	["08:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Pickup from your Cairo hotel lobby or specified location in Cairo	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345309/rayna/activities/14f39559-f78a-4417-9776-c0c9584dae70/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudi