d65249b5-3b93-46b3-9cce-92d6a9f4ca80	Cairo night tour: market, downtown, dinner, and free felucca	cairo-night-tour-market-downtown-dinner-and-free-felucca-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Night Tour	Group tour	null	enriched	Experience Cairo's enchanting nightlife with visits to Khan El Khalili bazaar, historic mosques, traditional dining, and a magical Nile felucca cruise.	Discover the captivating magic of Cairo after dark on this comprehensive evening adventure that showcases the city's most beloved cultural treasures. Your journey begins with a convenient hotel pickup, setting the stage for an authentic Egyptian experience that combines history, culture, and culinary delights.\n\nWander through the labyrinthine alleys of Khan El Khalili, Cairo's legendary marketplace where centuries of trade and tradition come alive under the glow of lanterns. This ancient bazaar offers an intoxicating blend of aromatic spices, handcrafted treasures, and the melodic calls of merchants that have echoed through these streets for generations.\n\nExplore the architectural marvels of Islamic Cairo, including the magnificent Al-Hakim Mosque, where stunning stonework and spiritual serenity create an atmosphere of profound reverence. The historic Muez Street serves as an open-air gallery of Islamic architecture, featuring over a thousand remarkable structures that tell the story of Egypt's rich heritage.\n\nIndulge in Cairo's vibrant café culture at the famous Fishawi Coffee House, known locally as the 'Café of Mirrors,' where traditional mint tea and aromatic coffee have been served to locals and travelers for over two centuries. This iconic establishment provides the perfect setting to absorb the authentic atmosphere of old Cairo.\n\nSavor the flavors of Egypt with a carefully selected dinner featuring beloved local specialties. Choose from koshari, Egypt's national comfort food combining rice, lentils, pasta, and chickpeas in perfect harmony, or enjoy succulent shawarma with tender sliced meat or chicken. Vegetarian options include crispy falafel, followed by zalabya, a delightful traditional Egyptian sweet that provides the perfect ending to your culinary journey.\n\nConclude your evening with a serene felucca ride along the timeless Nile River, where gentle breezes and stunning city views create an unforgettable finale to your Cairo night adventure. This traditional sailboat experience offers a peaceful contrast to the bustling energy of the city streets.	["Navigate the enchanting maze of Khan El Khalili's ancient marketplace", "Discover architectural treasures along historic Muez Street", "Experience spiritual tranquility at the magnificent Al-Hakim Mosque", "Enjoy traditional beverages at the legendary Fishawi Coffee House", "Savor authentic Egyptian cuisine with multiple dining options", "Cruise the majestic Nile River aboard a traditional felucca sailboat", "Explore Cairo's vibrant nightlife with expert local guidance"]	["Professional English-speaking guide", "Hotel pickup and drop-off service", "Traditional felucca boat ride on the Nile River", "Authentic Egyptian dinner with multiple menu options", "All entrance fees to mentioned attractions", "Transportation in air-conditioned vehicle"]	["Personal expenses and shopping purchases", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Additional beverages beyond dinner", "Travel insurance", "Items not specifically mentioned in inclusions"]	Comfortable walking shoes, light jacket for evening breeze, camera, and local currency for personal purchases	This tour involves moderate walking on uneven surfaces. Dress modestly when visiting religious sites. The felucca ride is weather dependent and may be substituted if conditions are unsuitable.	36.00	28.00	\N	\N	45.00	USD	Per person	20.00	36.00	270	["18:00", "18:30", "19:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time. No refund for cancellatio