gypt's extraordinary ancient heritage.	["Private guided exploration of the Great Pyramids with expert Egyptologist commentary", "Exclusive access inside one of the ancient pyramid chambers", "Traditional camel ride experience across the Giza plateau", "Close encounter with the legendary Great Sphinx monument", "Authentic Egyptian lunch featuring local specialties", "Professional photography assistance for memorable keepsake photos", "Comprehensive historical insights into pharaonic civilization", "Stress-free all-inclusive package with entrance tickets included"]	["Professional Egyptologist tour guide services", "All entrance tickets to Giza pyramid complex", "Traditional Egyptian lunch meal", "Camel riding experience", "Access to interior of selected pyramid", "Professional photography assistance", "Private air-conditioned transportation", "All taxes and service charges"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for guide and driver", "Hotel pickup and drop-off", "Travel insurance coverage", "Additional food and beverages", "Entry to Great Pyramid interior", "Optional activities not mentioned"]	Comfortable walking shoes, sun hat, sunscreen, camera, small backpack, and bottled water	Pyramid interior access involves climbing steep, narrow passages. Not recommended for claustrophobic individuals. Modest dress required for cultural sites.	8.00	6.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	8.00	270	["08:00", "09:00", "10:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before tour departure. No refund for cancellations within 24 hours.	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Giza Pyramid Complex Main Entrance	Meet your guide at the main visitor center entrance to the Giza pyramid complex	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Intermediate	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345350/rayna/activities/9285874a-5205-444c-a601-e3c1bddd186d/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudin