 long after your return to the city.	["Private hotel pickup and drop-off for seamless transportation", "Welcome ceremony with aromatic traditional herbal tea service", "Captivating live cultural performances featuring Tanoura or fire shows", "Interactive bread-making workshop with local Bedouin artisans", "Authentic multi-course dinner showcasing traditional desert cuisine", "Delectable Egyptian dessert selection including konafa and Om Ali", "Scenic desert photography opportunities at golden hour", "Peaceful escape from Cairo's urban environment in traditional camp setting"]	["Round-trip private hotel transportation", "Traditional Bedouin welcome tea ceremony", "Live cultural entertainment show", "Hands-on bread-making experience", "Complete authentic Bedouin dinner", "Traditional Egyptian desserts", "Professional guide services"]	["Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Alcoholic beverages", "Gratuities for staff and performers", "Additional food and drinks beyond included meal", "Travel insurance"]	Comfortable clothing suitable for desert evening temperatures, camera for photos, light jacket for cooler evening hours, and cash for optional tips	Evening temperatures in the desert can be cooler than the city. Vegetarian meal options are available upon advance request. The experience operates in all weather conditions except extreme storms.	40.00	32.00	\N	\N	\N	USD	Per person	\N	40.00	180	["17:00", "17:30", "18:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the experience starts. No refund for cancellations within 24 hours of departure.	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Hotel Lobby	Private pickup from your Cairo hotel lobby or accommodation	\N	t	\N	t	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345392/rayna/activities/b1fc8809-5830-4951-bea3-f112a302dd86/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v177