t Egypt's most treasured legacy.	["Skip lengthy queues with fast-track entry to the Giza pyramid complex", "Exclusive access to explore the interior chambers of the Great Pyramid", "Self-guided exploration allowing you to discover at your own rhythm", "Visit the legendary King's Chamber housing the ancient pharaoh's sarcophagus", "Marvel at the complete Giza complex including all three major pyramids", "Capture stunning photographs with the iconic Great Sphinx", "Experience 4,500-year-old engineering marvels up close"]	["Skip-the-line admission tickets to Giza pyramid complex", "Special access permit to enter the Great Pyramid interior", "Entry to King's Chamber within the Great Pyramid", "Access to explore the complete Giza archaeological site", "Self-guided exploration of all pyramid exteriors and surrounding areas"]	["Professional tour guide services", "Transportation to and from the site", "Food and beverages", "Gratuities and personal expenses", "Photography fees for special camera equipment", "Access to other pyramid interiors beyond the Great Pyramid"]	Comfortable walking shoes, water bottle, sun protection, camera, and light clothing suitable for narrow pyramid passages	The interior of the Great Pyramid involves climbing through narrow, steep passages. Not recommended for those with claustrophobia, mobility issues, or respiratory conditions. Photography inside the pyramid may require additional fees.	65.00	45.00	\N	\N	72.50	USD	Per person	10.00	65.00	0	["08:00", "09:00", "10:00", "11:00", "12:00", "13:00", "14:00"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	f	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the experience starts	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Giza Pyramid Complex Main Entrance	Main ticket office entrance to the Giza pyramid complex	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Moderate	Intermediate	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345480/rayna/activities/1892cf40-7b45-4309-9007-7