e77d462a-abb8-44c3-a502-b8ee9ed524c9	Half-Day Guided Tour of Giza Pyramids & Sphinx with Hotel Transfers	half-day-guided-tour-of-giza-pyramids-sphinx-with-hotel-transfers-cairo	941c503c-82a0-4a76-80ae-f8bb78cd7437	Cultural	Historical Site	Group tour	null	enriched	Discover ancient wonders on this immersive half-day journey to the legendary Pyramids of Giza and the enigmatic Sphinx with expert guidance.	Embark on an unforgettable archaeological adventure through one of the world's most iconic historical sites with our comprehensive half-day exploration of the Giza Pyramid Complex. Your expert Egyptologist guide will unveil the mysteries of these 4,500-year-old monuments, sharing fascinating insights into ancient Egyptian civilization, construction techniques, and the pharaohs who commissioned these eternal resting places.\n\nBegin your journey at the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the last surviving Wonder of the Ancient World, where you'll marvel at its precise engineering and massive limestone blocks. Continue to the Pyramid of Khafre and the smaller Pyramid of Menkaure, each with its own unique historical significance and architectural features.\n\nThe highlight of your visit includes an up-close encounter with the Great Sphinx, the legendary guardian with a human head and lion's body that has watched over the Giza plateau for millennia. Your guide will explain the various theories surrounding its construction and purpose while you capture stunning photographs from multiple vantage points.\n\nThroughout the tour, you'll learn about ancient Egyptian burial practices, religious beliefs, and the incredible logistics required to build these monumental structures. The experience includes comfortable transportation from your Cairo hotel, ensuring a seamless and stress-free adventure that maximizes your time at this UNESCO World Heritage site.	["Explore the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the sole surviving Wonder of the Ancient World", "Stand before the mysterious Great Sphinx and lear