etime.	["Luxurious five-star vessel with elegant dining facilities and panoramic river views", "Sumptuous buffet dinner featuring authentic Egyptian and international cuisine", "Mesmerizing live entertainment including belly dancing and whirling dervish performances", "Spectacular views of Cairo's illuminated landmarks and ancient monuments from the Nile", "Professional cultural shows performed by skilled artists in traditional costumes", "Romantic evening atmosphere perfect for special occasions and memorable experiences"]	["Round-trip transportation from central Cairo hotels", "Welcome drink upon boarding", "Open buffet dinner with Egyptian and international dishes", "Live entertainment shows including belly dancing and folklore performances", "Professional tour guide services", "All taxes and service charges"]	["Alcoholic beverages and premium drinks", "Personal expenses and souvenirs", "Gratuities for staff and performers", "Hotel pickup from distant locations", "Travel insurance coverage"]	Comfortable evening attire, camera for photos, light jacket for cool river breeze, and some cash for optional purchases	Smart casual dress code required. The cruise operates weather permitting. Vegetarian meal options available upon request. Children must be accompanied by adults.	45.00	35.00	\N	\N	47.00	USD	Per person	4.00	45.00	0	["19:00", "19:30"]	["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday", "Sunday"]	f	t	24	Free cancellation up to 24 hours before departure. No refund for cancellations within 24 hours or no-shows.	\N	\N	\N	Egypt	Cairo	\N	Cairo	30.044388	31.235726	\N	Nile Corniche Dock	Main boarding pier along the Nile Corniche, easily accessible from central Cairo hotels	\N	f	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	Easy	Beginner	f	\N	["en"]	https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345521/rayna/activities/91e479ed-0b70-4b45-887a-a08a03769f8a/0.jpg	[{"url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dykbg0noa/image/upload/v1776345521/rayna/activities/91e479ed-0b70-4b45-887a-a