e7f8930a-67f8-412c-9c5a-b08d35127d02	4d1ed010-b7e8-459e-9f0b-95651cd81980	James Reeves	\N	5.00	\N	I was excited to step onto the sets seen in the legendary films and I was stood in awe. The great hall, potions classrooms, Dumbeldore’s office and Gringott’s alone were worth the money.<br><br>Tons of trivia, outfits, facts, and staff that can tell you anything you ask made this one trip I’ll remember for a long time. I hope I can revisit soon.<br><br>Even on a weekday, it was very busy and the studio often sees classes of children attend. The food in the cafe was exceptional. Very fast service.<br><br>I won’t spoil too much, but make sure you go and visit. There’s too much to talk about but I loved every minute.<br><br>Always book in advance. Most of the time you must anyway. It fills up very quickly. 10/10	2 months ago	google	https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSM01uaHhaa0ZxWjJGSlVWWndUMHAwV2pSalFVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37abae1f5500e30!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlR3MnhxZkFqZ2FJUVZwT0p0WjRjQUE%7C%7C?hl=en-US	f	en	2026-04-14 17:23:43.629541+05:30
4bdc939b-4b41-4879-9876-981045fd0cb1	4d1ed010-b7e8-459e-9f0b-95651cd81980	Luca Leon Zynio	\N	5.00	\N	At last, I finally managed it – after six attempts, I was finally there. And it was more than worth it.<br>The Studio Tour is incredibly detailed: seeing the original sets, props, and costumes is simply breathtaking. You suddenly find yourself in the middle of the world of Harry Potter and realise just how much love, craftsmanship, and creativity has gone into every single scene.<br><br>I found the making-of section particularly fascinating. Seeing how the films were created, how the tricks were achieved, and how much effort went into seemingly small details makes the experience even more intense. The figures also feel extremely authentic and instantly bring many scenes back to life.<br><br>For fans, the tour is an absolute must – but even for non-fans, it is incredibly exciting. An experience that stays in your mind for a long time.<br><br>Right at the entrance, we were able to leave our bags. At the request of Michelle and Jane Louise (exceptionally lovely and friendly staff members), I am allowed to share this photo of the two of them. You can immediately tell that they love their job. 🥰	2 months ago	google	https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CYVNVSkhUVVpYWWtKNVRrdEJaRkZzU1RSNFlXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37abae1f5500e30!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBaSUJHTUZXYkJ5TktBZFFsSTR4YWc%7C%7C?hl=en-US	f	en	2026-04-14 17:23:43.629541+05:30
77b64e3b-1e86-4692-ae6d-368894d60c5a	4d1ed010-b7e8-459e-9f0b-95651cd81980	Samurai K	\N	5.00	\N	This experience was absolutely unbearable (in a good way)! I really want to upload all the videos and photos to convey how amazing it was, but that would spoil the fun for everyone visiting in the future, so I'll just share a little intro in this post. It made me want to rewatch all the Harry Potter movies again.<br><br>■Time<br>The longer, the better! I initially thought I'd be done in about two hours and then go sightseeing in London. But I ended up stopping at every set for much longer than expected, and I ended up taking the 1:30 PM shuttle bus back after starting at 9:30 AM. So, it took a whopping four hours, lol!<br><br>■Way<br>I took the train from Euston to Watford Junction and then a shuttle bus to the actual place. You won't get lost at all, so don't worry!	a month ago	google	https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wNVExWm1XbEp4WlVkWk9XaFFNWGhTUTI1alNGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37abae1f5500e30!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm05Q1ZmWlJxZUdZOWhQMXhSQ25jSFE%7C%7C?hl=en-US	f	en	2026-04-14 17:23:43.629541+05:30
3b484c0d-3421-4a37-9ac7-408219cd199b	4d1ed010-b7e8-459e-9f0b-95651cd81980	MR94	\N	5.00	\N	The Warner Bros. Studio Tour London is an absolutely impressive experience, especially for Harry Potter fans. We had four hours in total, and honestly, this was not enough if you want to look at everything in detail. There is so much to see, and the level of detail throughout the tour is incredible.<br><br>The attention to detail on set, costumes, and props is mind-blowing. You learn so many new and interesting facts about the movies, even if you think you already know a lot.<br><br>A big positive point for me was the prayer room located near the entrance, which I really appreciated. Just ask the staff — they are helpful and will guide you.<br><br>The restaurant food was also good and a nice break during the tour.<br><br>The only downside, in my opinion, is the strong focus on making money out of everything. Souvenir photos cost around £20, which feels unnecessary considering the huge number of visitors. With the amount of people attending every day, this pricing really isn’t needed.<br><br>Overall, an amazing and unforgettable experience with incredible details and insights — but be prepared to spend extra money if you want souvenirs or photos.	3 months ago	google	https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKeVpVRmtjbUZLV1hCRmVIb3dkRmxRUjBNM2VWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37abae1f5500e30!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlJyZUFkcmFKWXBFeHowdFlQR0M3eVE%7C%7C?hl=en-US	f	en	2026-04-14 17:23:43.629541+05:30
7fe176b1-dff1-4515-81a6-cb484f5e8f5d	4d1ed010-b7e8-459e-9f0b-95651cd81980	Nam Truong	\N	5.00	\N	For my wife, myself, and especially for my eldest son — a huge Harry Potter fan — visiting the Warner Bros. Harry Potter Studios is an absolute must. The tickets are reasonably priced, and even though we spent the entire day there, we never stopped being amazed.<br><br>You immediately feel how magical this place is. Warner Bros. has done an incredible job of making it feel authentic rather than overly touristy. Every hall is designed down to the smallest detail, and you can clearly see how much love and care went into creating this place.<br>Diagon Alley, Platform 9¾ — my son truly couldn’t stop being amazed. He loved every single moment and was completely fascinated by it all.<br><br>We also invited his best friend and a friend of my wife to join us, which made the experience even more special. It was a truly wonderful day.<br>I can wholeheartedly recommend the Warner Bros. Studios to every Harry Potter fan.	2 months ago	google	https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poV1NXMWFkRWsyYVd0SFMwaFJkRk5CYWxsSk4yYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x37abae1f5500e30!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhWSW1adEk2aWtHS0hRdFNBallJN2c%7C%7C?hl=en-US	f	en	2026-04-14 17:23:43.629541+05:30
